    },
    {
      "id": "f60718293041526a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 110,
      "strokeColor": "#e0e0e0",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "locked": false,
      "updated": 1751364960,
      "link": null,
      "text": "Status (2026-07-01):\nG1 backend — live on prod-k3s.  G2 session ownership authz — live, verified (user B → 403 negative test).\nG3 TTL loop — implemented, unit-tested, live-expiry test still pending; sweep CronJob remains dryRun: true.\nG4 JWT bearer on /api — enforcing (missing/invalid → 401); a valid Authentik bearer token has not yet been confirmed end-to-end.\nG5 frontend SPA — not built yet; browser reaches /s/{id} directly today.\nRecent hardening (this pass): backend RBAC narrowed from a cluster-wide ClusterRole to a namespace-scoped Role (unused secrets/namespaces grants removed) · OAuth login flow now binds the PKCE state to a nonce cookie to close a login-CSRF gap.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "originalText": "Status (2026-07-01):\nG1 backend — live on prod-k3s.  G2 session ownership authz — live, verified (user B → 403 negative test).\nG3 TTL loop — implemented, unit-tested, live-expiry test still pending; sweep CronJob remains dryRun: true.\nG4 JWT bearer on /api — enforcing (missing/invalid → 401); a valid Authentik bearer token has not yet been confirmed end-to-end.\nG5 frontend SPA — not built yet; browser reaches /s/{id} directly today.\nRecent hardening (this pass): backend RBAC narrowed from a cluster-wide ClusterRole to a namespace-scoped Role (unused secrets/namespaces grants removed) · OAuth login flow now binds the PKCE state to a nonce cookie to close a login-CSRF gap."
    }
